<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav July oil output rises to 90,000 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav July oil output rises to 90,000 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Yugoslav Federal Statistical Office reported the following crude oil and natural gas output data.</p>
<p>				     July 96    June 96    July 95</p>
<p> Crude oil	 (tonnes)     90,000     86,000	91,000</p>
<p> Natural gas (million cu.meters)  52	   52	    45</p>
<p>-- Gordana Filipovic, Belgrade newsroom, +381 11 222 4254</p>
</text>
